#. Plugin header: Description
msgid "Forms, placed with a shortcode, that work out the institutional email address of students and teachers of the São Paulo city schools (RME/SP), from their name and date of birth, RF or CPF, and of the state schools (SEDUC-SP), from the student's RA."
msgstr "Formulários, inseridos com um shortcode, que geram o e-mail institucional de alunos e professores da Rede Municipal de Ensino de São Paulo (RME/SP), a partir do nome e da data de nascimento, RF ou CPF, e da rede estadual (SEDUC-SP), a partir do RA do aluno."

